   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Greeting by the time of day",
     "texto": [
      "**早上好** and **早安** mean «good morning»; **下午好** means «good afternoon»; **晚上好** means «good evening», as a greeting; **晚安** means «good night» and is said when saying goodbye before going to bed. **中午好** is a possible greeting at midday.",
      "**喂** is used to answer the phone. **对不起** means «sorry» and **没关系**, «it's okay». You can answer **不客气** to «thank you»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
